RETROACTIVE LOG — commits ae28575 and 9dcbc8b, recorded after the fact (the
changelog/ convention was introduced later, in commit 478c817).

Files: examples/spa/index.html, examples/spa/main.js, examples/spa/server.py,
examples/spa/README.md, examples/spa/display/home.html, examples/spa/display/user.html,
examples/spa/display/table.html, examples/spa/pages/table.js (ALL NEW)

OLD_SECTION
(none — the examples/ directory did not exist)

NEW_SECTION
Commit ae28575 — runnable SPA example app combining SPAEngine (static + dynamic
named-param routes, per-link cache/history opt-outs) and ProgressIndicator, with a
bundled dev server (server.py) providing history fallback and the /lib/vUX/ mapping.

Commit 9dcbc8b — /table page added: mounts a 500-row DataView with sort, filter, a
50-cells/100ms ticker and a targeted-updates-vs-full-rebuild benchmark; leaving the
route fires its exitCallback, which stops the ticker and destroys the view
(examples/spa/main.js gained the route config and exit hook wiring).

REASON
Provide a runnable, servable demonstration of the SPA engine features added on this
branch (named route params, per-link attribute opt-outs, the route exit hook) and of
DataView under live update load.
